comment.sentence:
A ProgressiveIterator starts by reading any items already held in the reservoir;
 when the reservoir is exhausted, it reads further items from the inputIterator,
 copying them into the reservoir as they are read.

body.div:
Return the sequence of children of this node, as an Iterable. This
 method is designed to allow iteration over the children in a Java "for each" loop,
 in the form for (NodeInfo child : children()) {...}
